== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Wraiths|Aggressive creature strategies#Wraith}}

=== Melee ===
Swipes at the player with their claw, creating a 60-degree vertical arc that extends 2.4 meters outward (60 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] damage). This attack can be used every 2 seconds within 1.8 meters of the player.

== Notes ==
* Wraiths can be especially dangerous when entering Swamps early on, with Black Forest-tier gear. It is best to avoid entering the biome at night for this reason.
* Wraiths are the only ''renewable'' source of [[Chain]]s, the other major source being [[Sunken Crypts]].
* Because of their [[Damage#Spirit|Spirit damage]] weakness (and considering their [[Damage#Physical|Physical damage]] resistance), [[Silver]] weapons are around 90% effective, making them a good choice. However, due to Wraith's immunity to [[Damage#Frost|Frost damage]], the [[Frostner]] is only about 50% effective, making it a bad choice.
* Wraiths can fly directly on top of you if you get under them correctly, making them unable to hit you, while being vulnerable to two-handed [[Clubs]] like the [[Stagbreaker]].<!-- Needs confirmation. Worked for me once but I haven't seen a wraith once since. -->

